Setup of the experiment:
- Rewriting --> to reduce the area
- Balancing --> to reduce the glitching
- Power-map --> to reduce zero-delay switching
Power evaluation:
  Done sampling input pattern at random.
  We optimize using local information. This evaluation allows verifying if we are
  doing workload independent optimization.
- Quantization  --> 20
- Boolean space --> 12

